{"generated": "2026-09-06 14:33", "curation": {"market": "개인 투자자를 위한 최근 시장 뉴스 브리핑입니다.\n\n<b>원·달러 환율 하락과 달러 예금 급증</b>\n원·달러 환율이 23개월 만에 최저 수준인 1340원대 이하로 가파르게 하락하면서, 향후 환율 반등을 기대하는 기업들의 달러 매도가 줄어들어 달러 예금이 역대 최대치를 기록했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE9DUHZqVjRoN090R0s4LVpubVZVTkN0VU1jOGNTYVRqNzg3cU8xUU1Cc1AzcTJfWHFjTno2Tl9QYXhrY3htRE5FYjhRd0JITk0?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#2</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE1MVFF3akJMRWtiQ3ZabWxCckh3emdjQVhsempJNy1hSzdDdGhncUFkNE9OTW1YNi1RNDZUSng2UlZUc3RQcEpacnRnVFNTVGpQd3BuUUpzeXl1dw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#3</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTE0yVWlYdHdtR2R6RU5tQlQ1LUJpYlZmd2VkYzN6YlRkeUI1cUZzQUpraGItTm4xM3hmLW9pZm83UDBldDNYSFJ3U2ZQVUEzblk?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#5</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE5Ucm5MSHA3alZkNmczcE1lTXhNWl9helBmXzdRYzlQQnhVSGdtNUs3M29fWENEaHdZZU50eGxTcUgtMnpaWHRFUjUtMEtoQ3ZGM0QxeVhpc2dzdWwzYnVuc2c2ZVotX1U2dHh1QQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#6</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVEFVX3lxTE1HOUh5SWVrTE1YZHpMOVFSRlp5dGtmRFhQQlZCVUtBNGJmY2tpTkZLRkVpaFIzVU1UQVB0Z2JFVk1XX19kc1h1eXZrdzkxZmZobk5NNQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#13</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxOelZTYVUzSXhNLVc2TXNxWmJVMHhLVVJCY0lkMnN5MkZvMWFkQ1Uxbk9UbE9wSkYtVVFBYnZyVW1xOW81T1RCanFVa0VoUE9HZEtnMHBNcXhHbTFnUUhpWmhrT2FhVFExcjMyRzFsS2w5WFp0OGxOVVZYdjJmcmNSUmVURUJ2SmdLTWZv?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#14</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTFB5QlhwYXExMUM3aGp6MWxJbEtCTHZKREltdHRkOHVKbllFUk1RMlJlb1BfWWZrYnNMS1FXRGg5ekFOQ1hFc0JUTlFwV2FiOXZoX3c4UjA4MzZNNmJnSTN5NzhWd0NHeng0UWRzNA?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#22</a>]. 환율은 두 달 사이에 250원가량 급락하는 추세를 보이고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxOelZTYVUzSXhNLVc2TXNxWmJVMHhLVVJCY0lkM